                                "sense_id": "e350811f-b66c-3ca0-bf70-4d4936302c0f",
                                "text": "They came over to Massachusetts Bay in another vessel, and thus escaped the onus of that brevet nobility under which the successors of the Mayflower Pilgrims had descended."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
